ttps://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1003307326118193_6526632097633340604_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dh48ts_tCEIQ7kNvwEs_ZkY&_nc_oc=AdoRRGvyrdGe1fMnoC_vS5yg0wy2_2lCgAIs1zgm1oQ59KbubXhT2eodN0LdEWxO2FQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRnSFXoCw9psVgreIElroOkWn-93JT8uBefoGQZY2so9Q&oe=6AFB3EC9"}]}, "id": "1119030913845365", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Screenshot from 2026-10-24 12-50-22.png", "id": "2394504240956545", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596061819_2394504244289878_472382711013539362_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dxjF-FM2nIEQ7kNvwHL67ga&_nc_oc=AdrhLU8VrvmtozeSzOfBOG7Wft2I3yRuIQqeDS-CCx5hiqlRnab3TRH2sE9Ir0e9rkA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTFKJ5udCflbb56t_k6-8kWs8QeWn9ANuCinV96meRG7A&oe=6AFB2ED0"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot from 2026-10-24 12-46-25.png", "id": "1162480783023481", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_1162480786356814_6414396398300047282_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mtIVsWumVKUQ7kNvwGq-VsN&_nc_oc=AdrQ8R3meEUBAmVriqFL7yMDUOqoe7bGb9K63N-gc1iYLIBC-YCZV8Idu8XqMhFFiZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtPEWRDcNQRPuDaKFGu3CG4oQatbxPfdyCJnbzvNPI_Q&oe=6AFB30AF"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot from 2026-10-24 12-43-03.png", "id": "1472528111644749", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596168449_1472528114978082_15441286705472830_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dGZtnH1bOl0Q7kNvwEL5VZp&_nc_oc=Adq2Ytbqad-4lwVwbIj95Mrq6yCSgKWhmhiWh0Seuo38gfe9FSIj2mCkm-9NfbNHbDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSw9o788D3cUWp8usxcYxC550RHJRMPEe4G0iEo-dks6w&oe=6AFB47CE"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot from 2026-10-24 12-55-26.png", "id": "1598432591420381", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_1598432594753714_8433526199119027828_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=isktqLYQDjUQ7kNvwG95j4c&_nc_oc=Adrrz_4XWfDXP6IwAkqocnldoHNUABle4Mjrrlkjq4t_nQNQq8-aU_ra6aHJp6yjR8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTBCMd1TbjdJrSC65zo0e4LtrWOOt1B3ozK5m0dgVrRGw&oe=6AFB21B7"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot from 2026-10-24 12-44-38.png", "id": "1639734681267856", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673716021_1639734684601189_1142126958551828862_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QBQH-zg-1vAQ7kNvwHm3bfM&_nc_oc=AdoRn7loqOYgJPp2Ynq0KNKEXkUgNGlBZzDDR-s6GhYPPb-RIfpW-rworgI1Tisu8lc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTJFGwQSmAC5QN34gUhPNzliu79rPZQAGLkarM-PQVBEQ&oe=6AFB434C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BenioWorld", "keywords": ["cinema", "screen", "hangout", "friends", "cozy"], "long_description": "**Your screen. Your world. Your friends.**\n\nBenioWorld is a cozy place to hang out in VR. Pick a world, put a giant screen wherever you want it and watch together, or get up and play.\n\n### \ud83c\udfac Watch anything, on a screen your size\n- **Built-in browser** with YouTube one tap away\n- **Your own videos**, straight from the headset, no PC or internet needed\n- **TV channels** from your own playlists (.m3u / .m3u8)\n- Make the screen **as big, as close and as curved** as you like\n- **Ambilight** spills the screen's colors into the room\n\n### \ud83c\udf34 10 worlds to hang out in\nSunset beach, city penthouse, home cinema, airplane cabin, road camper, cozy attic, game room, bedroom, studio and window desk. Switch between **day, sunset and night** anytime, and control each world's own lights.\n\n### \ud83d\udc65 Better together\n- Host a room and **watch in sync**: the host shares the map, the lights and the screen\n- Join **public online rooms**, invite friends with a **room code**, or play over **LAN**\n- Bring your own look with **VRM avatars** and expressions\n\n### \ud83c\udfb3 Things to do between episodes\n- **Bowling** with a real scoreboard, **pool**, **foosball** and **basketball**\n- **Ludo** on the coffee table, a **chalkboard** to draw on\n- A **guitar** you can actually strum, **fireworks**, **hats** to wear\n- A working **phone** with camera, music and live radio, an **instant camera** that prints your photos\n- Grab, throw and resize objects with physics and **tool guns**", "short_description": "Watch YouTube, movies and your own videos on a giant screen with friends, then play bowling, pool, foosball and more across 10 cozy worlds, from a sunset beach to a city penthouse."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://world.beniocord.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://world.beniocord.com/terms", "publisher_name": "BenioStudio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://world.beniocord.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "pt_BR"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "1381512858383755"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1003307326118193_6526632097633340604_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dh48ts_tCEIQ7kNvwEs_ZkY&_nc_oc=AdoRRGvyrdGe1fMnoC_vS5yg0wy2_2lCgAIs1zgm1oQ59KbubXhT2eodN0LdEWxO2FQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcUDOr9twCtgG703_8KTCKe0zRQXu03o9YtZ-ZexnXSg&oe=6AFB3EC9"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "BenioWorld", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Hangout", "id": "1023770785722696"}], "release_date": 1793447460, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1381512861717088", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1381512851717089", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "39396943246618933"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1652132016925354", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BenioWorld", "keywords": ["cinema", "multiplayer", "amigos", "filmes", "aconchegante"], "long_description": "**Sua tela. Seu mundo. Seus amigos.**\n\nBenioWorld \u00e9 um lugar aconchegante pra ficar de boa em VR. Escolha um mundo, coloque uma tela gigante onde quiser e assista junto, ou levante e v\u00e1 jogar.\n\n### \ud83c\udfac Assista de tudo, numa tela do seu tamanho\n- **Navegador integrado** com o YouTube a um toque\n- **Seus pr\u00f3prios v\u00eddeos**, direto do headset, sem PC nem internet\n- **Canais de TV** das suas pr\u00f3prias listas (.m3u / .m3u8)\n- Deixe a tela **do tamanho, na dist\u00e2ncia e com a curvatura** que quiser\n- **Ambilight** espalha as cores da tela pelo ambiente\n\n### \ud83c\udf34 10 mundos pra curtir\nPraia ao p\u00f4r do sol, cobertura na cidade, cinema, cabine de avi\u00e3o, motorhome na estrada, s\u00f3t\u00e3o aconchegante, sal\u00e3o de jogos, quarto, est\u00fadio e escrivaninha com janela. Troque entre **dia, p\u00f4r do sol e noite** quando quiser e controle as luzes de cada mundo.\n\n### \ud83d\udc65 Melhor junto\n- Crie uma sala e **assista sincronizado**: o anfitri\u00e3o compartilha o mapa, as luzes e a tela\n- Entre em **salas online p\u00fablicas**, chame os amigos com um **c\u00f3digo de sala** ou jogue em **rede local (LAN)**\n- Use seu pr\u00f3prio visual com **avatares VRM** e express\u00f5es\n\n### \ud83c\udfb3 Pra fazer entre um epis\u00f3dio e outro\n- **Boliche** com placar de verdade, **sinuca**, **pebolim** e **basquete**\n- **Ludo** na mesa de centro, uma **lousa** pra desenhar\n- Um **viol\u00e3o** que d\u00e1 pra tocar de verdade, **fogos de artif\u00edcio**, **chap\u00e9us** pra usar\n- Um **celular** que funciona, com c\u00e2mera, m\u00fasica e r\u00e1dio ao vivo, e uma **c\u00e2mera instant\u00e2nea** que imprime suas fotos\n- Pegue, arremesse e mude o tamanho dos objetos com f\u00edsica e **armas de ferramenta**", "short_description": "Assista ao YouTube, filmes e seus pr\u00f3prios v\u00eddeos numa tela gigante com os amigos, e depois jogue boliche, sinuca, pebolim e muito mais em 10 mundos aconchegantes, de uma praia ao p\u00f4r do sol a uma cobertura na cidade."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon-zoomed-transparent.png", "id": "3529736067189478", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_FOREGROUND_512", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654956704_3529736073856144_2216937045479860810_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a13bsoxcXeAQ7kNvwEKjpMq&_nc_oc=Adre-zWpInmSWie0Els9tvYVLP6U7adW1Gtp0cATToiS0FxkC3xCZ7VrsIBXwdCfimI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQP3ttH1Z7ZVc3KwN5ZixMBjXW3b58qI4cd_nx-CwwsKg&oe=6AFB2AA8"}, {"file_name": "icon-zoomed.png", "id": "1776240773592485", "image_type": "APP_IMG